  "description": "Hyeri Kang’s a screwup with a criminal record and crushing debt. After abducting a seemingly wealthy woman to pay off the loan sharks, she realizes that her victim is actually a cross-dressing man—and a serial killer fresh off his latest murder. The pair soon end up in a violent, sexual codependency that reveals a shared trauma and the grief that shattered both of their lives. Can they outrun the past and start over together? Or will karma catch them, destroying any chance of a future?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
